# Client portal onboarding

We sell dedicated portals. Improvised go-live is a failed sale.

When the lead names **Anmol / Hingorani / Tops / a new client portal**, follow `docs/CLIENT_PORTAL_ONBOARDING_SOP.md` in order.

## Hard gates

- Do **not** deploy until `node scripts/client-portal-preflight.mjs --project {slug} --slug {slug}` exits 0.
- Shared keys come from `sheetomatic/.env.shared.local`. If empty, **stop** and ask the lead. Do not decrypt Vercel, do not copy from another client unless the lead says so.
- Never print secrets. Add env via stdin, not `--value`.
- Deploy author: `training@sheetomatic.in` for that command only. Never `git config`.
- Own repo + own Cursor window + own Vercel project. Domain on **that** project, not `sheetomatic-redesign`.
- Typecheck in the **client** repo (`npm run build`) before deploy.
- Accept only when login, tenant slug, and OpenAI **Configured** work on `https://{slug}.sheetomatic.com`.
